== 6.11 Chapter 6 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [Oxidation is best defined as],
  [gain of oxygen only],
  [gain of electrons],
  [loss of electrons],
  [loss of hydrogen only]
)

#mcq(2, [In the reaction Zn + Cu²⁺ → Zn²⁺ + Cu, zinc is],
  [reduced],
  [oxidised],
  [the oxidising agent],
  [unchanged]
)

#mcq(3, [An oxidising agent is a substance that],
  [gains protons],
  [loses electrons],
  [loses protons],
  [gains electrons]
)

#mcq(4, [The oxidation number of sulphur in H₂SO₄ is],
  [+2],
  [+4],
  [+6],
  [−2]
)

#mcq(5, [The oxidation number of chromium in K₂Cr₂O₇ is],
  [+7],
  [+6],
  [+3],
  [+12]
)

#mcq(6, [The oxidation number of manganese in KMnO₄ is],
  [+4],
  [+6],
  [+7],
  [+2]
)

